      "author_association": "CONTRIBUTOR",
      "body": "<a href=\"#\"><img alt=\"P2\" src=\"https://greptile-static-assets.s3.amazonaws.com/badges/p2.svg?v=9\" align=\"top\"></a> **Evaluation path lacks a test**\n\nThe newly enabled single-group NVFP4 evaluation path has no regression test. The grouped MLP tests default to four groups, and the single-group test uses MXFP8, so neither exercises this change. A regression here could pass the existing tests.\n\nAdd an NVFP4 case under `torch.no_grad()` that confirms `_single_group_fc2_gemm` runs with no columnwise activation and compares its output against the grouped path, including bias.\n\nNote: If this suggestion doesn't match your team's coding style, reply to this and let me know. I'll remember it for next time!",
      "commit_id": "90e030ac694d570b3bbf1646d6b2668581851ef3",
      "created_at": "2026-10-10T11:07:43Z",
      "diff_hunk": "@@ -1933,10 +1933,12 @@ def fuser_forward(\n                         fc2_bias_scale = fc2_bias_scale.to(dtype=torch.float32)\n \n             fc2_out_buf = validate_or_alloc_output(output_buffer, fc2_out_shape, dtype, device)\n-            if (\n-                use_dense_single_group\n-                and grouped_fc2_x.columnwise_data is not None\n-                and grouped_fc2_x.columnwise_scale_inv is not None\n+            if use_dense_single_group and (\n+                not weight_requires_grad\n+                or (\n+                    grouped_fc2_x.columnwise_data is not None\n+                    and grouped_fc2_x.columnwise_scale_inv is not None\n+                )\n             ):",
